1
00:00:01,670 --> 00:00:03,286
Our first tip!

2
00:00:03,326 --> 00:00:05,423
It's a comet.

3
00:00:08,593 --> 00:00:10,052
Keep the change.

4
00:00:10,092 --> 00:00:11,763
That's his tooth.

5
00:00:11,803 --> 00:00:13,619
It's still warm!

6
00:00:13,659 --> 00:00:17,472
Tip policy update!
Management keeps sixty percent.

7
00:00:17,512 --> 00:00:19,609
You don't even
have hands!

8
00:00:21,379 --> 00:00:23,100
I have a claw.

9
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:26,831
And now, Pip...
would YOU like to leave a tip?

10
00:00:28,901 --> 00:00:30,857
Pip.

11
00:00:30,897 --> 00:00:33,700
It was looking at me.

12
00:00:36,884 --> 00:00:38,668
No.
